yle="text-align:center">-</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">15</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p>konsol uchlarida</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">-</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">8</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p>v) Qutisimon toʻsinlarni pastki qismidagi:</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p>plitada oʻram armaturalar yoʻq boʻlganida</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">15</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">12</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p>plitada oʻram armaturalar bor boʻlganida</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">18</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">15</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p>g) piyodalar yoʻlagining:</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p>quyma (koʻtarib olinmaydigan)</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">8</p></td><td style="width:17.7%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center">8</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:64.62%;border-top:none;border-left:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2