<span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">Huddi oʻzi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:28%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p class="MsoBodyTextIndent"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">8.  Poʻlat pona (nagel)lar</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:26%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">Huddi oʻzi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:28%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p class="MsoBodyTextIndent"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">9.  Mixlar va dyubellar</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:26%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">Huddi oʻzi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:28%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p class="MsoBodyTextIndent"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">10. Poʻlat yopishmalar</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:26%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">Qalinligi, mm, da</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:28%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p class="MsoBodyTextIndent"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">11. Shaybalar</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:26%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">Huddi oʻzi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:28%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p class="MsoBodyTextIndent"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">12. Tishli tikan (ship)lar</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:26%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">Uzunligi,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="letter-spacing:-.3pt">cm, da</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911724)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911724)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911724)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911724)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911724" id="-7911724">* Bosh toʻsinlar uchun yelimlangan konstruksiyalarda yogʻoch taxtalarning ishlov berilgandan keyingi qalinligi 3,3 sm dan, qolgan boshqa elementlar uchun 4,3 sm dan oshmasligi kerak.</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911725)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911725)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911725)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911725)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911725" id="-7911725">** Ingichka tomning diametri 18 sm dan kam boʻlgan yumaloq yogʻochlar faqat oʻtish qismining toʻshamasi va javobgarligi kam joydagi elementlar (ikkinchi darajali bogʻlanishlar,qistirgichlar va hokazolar) uchungina qoʻllash ruxsat etiladi.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911726)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911726)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911726)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911726)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911726" id="-7911726">612. Konstruksiyalarda yogʻoch elementlarning egiluvchanligi quyidagilardan oshmasligi kerak:</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911727)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911727)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911727)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911727)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911727" id="-7911727">a) belbogʻlar, raskoslar, tayanchlarning ustunlari va qoziq oyoqlar uchun:</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911728)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911728)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911728)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911728)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911728" id="-7911728">siqilayotganlariniki — 100 dan;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911729)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911729)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911729)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911729)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911729" id="-7911729">choʻzilayotganlarniki — 150 dan;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911730)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911730)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911730)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911730)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911730" id="-7911730">b) bogʻlanishlar uchun:</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911731)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911731)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911731)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911731)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911731" id="-7911731">siqilayotganlariniki — 150 dan;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911732)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911732)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911732)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911732)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911732" id="-7911732">choʻzilayotganlarniki — 200 dan.</div></div><div class="TEXT_HEADER_DEFAULT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911733)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911733)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911733)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911733)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911733" id="-7911733">9-§. Tutashmalar va bogʻlamlar</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911734)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911734)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911734)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911734)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911734" id="-7911734">613. Fermalarda siqilayotgan va choʻzilayotgan elementlarning ulanadigan joylarini, tugundan tashqarida (panelda) joylash kerak, bunda siqilayotgan elementlarni biriktirishlarni (ulashlarni) ferma tekisligidan chiqadigan joylarda mahkamlangan tugunlarning yonida joylash zarur.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911735)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911735)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911735)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911735)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911735" id="-7911735">Yelimlangan uzluksiz toʻsinlarda ulashlarni, momentlar qiymati kam boʻladigan qismlarida joylash lozim.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911736)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911736)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911736)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911736)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911736" id="-7911736">614. Birlashtiriladigan elementlar boltlar bilan zarur boʻlsa — xomutlar bilan tortib qoʻyilishi kerak. Boltlarning ikkala tomonidagi uchlarida poʻlat shaybalari boʻlishi kerak.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911737)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911737)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911737)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911737)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911737" id="-7911737">615. Fermalarning choʻzilayotgan va choʻzilib-egilayotgan elementlarining ulanishlarini silindrik poʻlat pona (nagel) lar teshib oʻtkazilgan yogʻoch yopishtirma (nakladka) lar bilan berkitish yoki yelimshtirli qilib bajarish tavsiya etiladi. Pogʻonali yopishtirmali birikmalarni ishlatmaslik kerak.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911738)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911738)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911738)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911738)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911738" id="-7911738">Belbogʻlarning siqilayotgan elementlari uchlarining yuzalari bir-biriga toʻla tegib turadigan qilib ulangan joylar ustilariga yopishmalar qoʻyilishi, zarur boʻlganida uchlariga yelimlab kiritilgan poʻlat shtirlar (yelimshtirli tutashma) bilan kuchaytirilishi zarur. Tilingan taxtali-mixli fermalar belbogʻlarining ulanadigan joylarini tashqarisidan qoʻyiladigan poʻlat pona (nagel) li yopishmalar bilan berkitish kerak.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911739)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911739)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911739)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911739)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911739" id="-7911739">616. Boltlar, pona (nagel) lar, mixlar, dyubellar, shuruflar, gluxarlar va shtirlar qatorasiga joylashganda ular orasidagi eng kam masofa miqdorini quyidagi 106-jadvalga binoan qabul qilish lozim.</div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2 lx_elem" onmousemove="lx_mo(event,-7911740)"><div class="lx_elem2"><div class="lx_elem3"><span onclick="lx_sf(-7911740)"><img src="/img/cmt.svg" />Ҳужжатга таклиф юбориш</span><span onclick="lx_pa(-7911740)"><img src="/img/vlm.svg" />Аудиони тинглаш</span><span onclick="lx_cl(-7911740)"><img src="/img/lnk.svg" />Ҳужжат элементидан ҳавола олиш</span></div></div><div name="-7911740" id="-7911740"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><div style="page-break-after:always"><span style="display: none"> </span></div><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:76%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="right" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:right"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">106-jadval</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Meʼyorlanuvchi masofalar</span></span></b></span></span></p></td><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:76%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Quyidagilar uchun, ularning hisobiy diametrlarida ifodalangan eng kam masofalar qiymatlari:</span></span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Boltlar va teshib oʻtkaziladigan nagellar</span></span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ichida qoldiriladigan (chiqib turmaydigan) nagellar</span></span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">shtirlar</span></span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Mixlar va dyubellar</span></span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Shruflar va gluxarlar</span></span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Mahkamlagichlar oʻqlarining orasi:</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="text-align:cent